// Modus ponens over the 3-antecedent mech_rule. The first leg (DSBs) is
// discharged by `Declared(wrn:mech_dsb)`, the linked-external DSB-marker
// ToolArtifact. The two downstream legs (cell-cycle arrest, apoptosis) carry
// INLINED COPIES of the phase-1 recompute proofs — the `c_cellcycle_re_0_*` and
// `c_apoptosis_re_1_*` alias blocks below, each an `App(Declared(plan),
// Observed(sampleset))` per cell line (ED Fig 4b/4c nested ANOVAs).
//
// They are copies rather than citations because the inductive-value encoding has
// no subtree reference: a `Value` can hold `ResourceRef(Iri)` for a resource, but
// an inductive value is `Json` — inline only. D54's lemma citation was
// `Verified(iri)` standing in for a reference it could not express, which is
// exactly the laundering P3 closed. `support()` returns a `BTreeSet<Leaf>`, so
// the inlined tree and a referencing DAG yield the same support set; the cost is
// duplication, not a different answer. P6 adds the reference node and dedupes.
